<section id="landing" class="screen active hero"><div class="smallcaps">Movie night, made easy</div><h1>Find something <em>great</em> to watch.</h1><p class="hero-sub">A few quick questions. Three movie picks made for you.</p><button class="cta" id="begin"><span>Find my movie</span><span class="arrow">→</span></button></section>
